<title>USA: BankUnited completes Suncoast buy.</title>
<headline>BankUnited completes Suncoast buy.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankUnited Financial Corp said on Monday it had completed the acquisition of Suncoast Savings &amp; Loan Association FSA.</p>
<p>BankUnited issued one share of its class A common stock in exchange for each share of Suncoast common. Each share of Suncoast preferred stock was exchanged for one share of a new series of BankUnited preferred stock.</p>
<p>BankUnited, with assets approaching $1.3 billion and deposits in excess of $850 million, was up 1/8 at 8-1/2 in early morning trading.</p>
